    {"source_id": "id04751", "verdict": "CORRECTED", "reason": "'réponses mélangées de flamand et d'alsacien' was rendered with an added 'слова'. 'en règle' was rendered 'настоящий'. 'au milieu de tous les efforts' was flattened. Now 'смешанные из фламандского и эльзасского', 'допроса по всей форме', 'среди всех стараний', and 'узнал природный выговор'."},
    {"source_id": "id04752", "verdict": "PASS", "reason": "Italian text and italic spans preserved; dialogue punctuation is correct."},
    {"source_id": "id04753", "verdict": "CORRECTED", "reason": "'fit un mouvement' is a neutral movement. 'вздрогнул' added an interpretation of fear, so it is now 'дёрнулся'."},
    {"source_id": "id04754", "verdict": "CORRECTED", "reason": "Removed the added 'сам' ('я сам продолжу'), which is not in the source. The rest is faithful."},
    {"source_id": "id04755", "verdict": "CORRECTED", "reason": "Tense: 'ceux qui le commandaient' is imperfect (the enemy's commanders, then), so 'командовал' replaces the present 'командует'."},
    {"source_id": "id04756", "verdict": "PASS", "reason": "Meaning, causality and the order are preserved."},
    {"source_id": "id04757", "verdict": "CORRECTED", "reason": "'emmené' was rendered 'привели', which imposes a direction the source does not state. Now the neutral 'которые его сопровождали', and the plural is 'двое солдат'."},
    {"source_id": "id04758", "verdict": "PASS", "reason": "Faithful."},
    {"source_id": "id04759", "verdict": "PASS", "reason": "Faithful; the language note is preserved."},
    {"source_id": "id04760", "verdict": "CORRECTED", "reason": "'défier les langues' was changed to 'против упрямых языков', which adds 'упрямых' and explains the pun. Now 'тягаться с языками'. The final clause is made more idiomatic, and 'секрет' is restored."},
    {"source_id": "id04761", "verdict": "PASS", "reason": "Faithful; condition and future tense preserved."},
    {"source_id": "id04762", "verdict": "CORRECTED", "reason": "'foi de gentilhomme' means the gentleman's word or faith, not 'честь'. Now 'Клянусь словом дворянина'."},
    {"source_id": "id04763", "verdict": "PASS", "reason": "Faithful and idiomatic."},
